  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/4f8f201a4379be16162eb348ca827da703f95449</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/mobellling/mobellling.github.io/commit/4f8f201a4379be16162eb348ca827da703f95449"/>
    <title>
        feat: add end-to-end service worker tests and client-side API
    </title>
    <updated>2026-11-02T14:02:33Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101485558?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Xzmumi</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Xzmumi</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat: add end-to-end service worker tests and client-side API

- Introduced `sw-e2e.mjs` for end-to-end testing of the service worker using headless Chrome.
- Created `ServiceWorker.astro` component to register the service worker and initialize the client API.
- Implemented `sw-client.ts` to provide a comprehensive client-side API for interacting with the service worker, including methods for status checks, manifest synchronization, prefetching, and cache management.
- Added debug panel functionality for easier service worker management during development.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
